# Suggestion Chips

`TxSuggestionChips` renders a set of suggestions as horizontally scrollable pill buttons and emits the one that was tapped. It is typically shown after an assistant turn to offer follow-up questions.

Manually verified against `packages/tuffex/packages/components/src/suggestion-chips/src/TxSuggestionChips.vue`.

